{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d75b9902a70b6815","name":"Radiation Grenade","source":{"id":"source:reference-d75b9902a70b6815","title":"Radiation Grenade","revision":20928,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:49:28Z","sha256":"a203a64cd733b03012c34793387d0e35dccf47da533f1af01c72bdb635ee6940","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20928","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Radiation%20Grenade&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d75b9902a70b6815","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Banned by all but the most depraved or desperate armies, the Radiation Grenade releases a cloud of radioactive particles that sicken any character unfortunate enough to be exposed to them. A Radiation Grenade explodes in a burst of light smoke, affecting everything within the 2-Square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"}," radius. The Radiation Grenade detonates on contact after it is thrown, dealing damage in the same round it is hurled.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you make an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"}," with a Radiation Grenade, you make a single attack roll and compare the result to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"}," of every target in the Grenade's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"}," radius. Creatures you hit take full damage, and creatures you miss take half damage. A target with the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Evasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Evasion"}]}," Talent takes half damage from a successful attack, and no damage if the attack misses.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The target also takes the effect of exposure to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Radiation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Radiation","referenceId":"reference:669c428e617d7f09"},". The Radiation Grenade is treated as Moderate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Radiation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Radiation","referenceId":"reference:669c428e617d7f09"}," for the purposes of damage and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," checks.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenades","referenceId":"reference:0288f85b407ca487"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Tiny\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"}," Radius:"]}," 2-Squares\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Illegal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Illegal"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
